# Nothing is lost if nothing escapes: choose the system before weighing
# Gas stays in the sealed system and leaves the open one. Atoms are conserved in
# both; the balance differs because the weighed boundary differs.
register lv2
add v1 white_vinegar_5_percent 50mL
seal v1 500mL
add v1 baking_soda 5g
measure v1 balance
inspect v1
new flask
add v2 white_vinegar_5_percent 50mL
add v2 baking_soda 5g
measure v2 balance
inspect v2
